We sit and eat the meal.
Priya serves varan bhaat and spicy batata bhaji.
The food is very delicious.
I say, 'Priya, you cook very well.'
She smiles and says thank you.
Now we do not talk about the office.
Priya asks about my family in Mexico.
I say, 'My elder brother is Diego, and my younger sister is Sofia.'
'We also have a dog, her name is Lola.'
Priya becomes very happy.
She says, 'I also like dogs a lot.'
Then Priya talks about her childhood.
She says, 'I grew up right here in Mumbai.'
'Sometime I will show you my old neighbourhood.'
I say with enthusiasm, 'Yes, let's go there!'
Now we are not just colleagues.
I think that we will be good friends.
